        "char_yan_tu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "One snake blocks Bai Ning Bing’s blades while the other circles behind her. Yan Tu stands outside the melee and manipulates both with his mind. The control is precise and costs more mental energy than a simpler two-snake setup. The snakes come from Fiery Snake Gu, a rank four Gu; under that pincer, Bai Ning Bing slowly falls behind. Fire pellet Gu can fuse into damaged snakes and restore their vigor, a combination Yan Tu refined across hundreds of battle stage fights.",
